# personal agent settings/instructions (shared ones are committed): .claude/settings.local.json for Claude Code,
# AGENTS.override.md for Codex only (Codex reads it in place of AGENTS.md, so start it as a copy; Claude Code never
# reads it). Not CLAUDE.local.md: it makes Claude Code skip AGENTS.md, and is ignored only so one isn't committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.override.md

# local reference tree for coding agents (scripts/setup.sh); no trailing slash so a symlink is ignored too
/.references

# Claude Code worktrees (claude --worktree, subagent isolation, background sessions)
/.claude/worktrees/

